{"id":"steam-4452700","steam":4452700,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"STAGE TOUR","summary":"Build your band, hit the stage, and go on tour in Stage Tour, the next evolution of music rhythm games. Rock over 90 officially licensed tracks, unlock over 180 authentic Gibson®, Epiphone® and Kramer® guitars, and experience five game modes, including the all-new roguelite Tour Mode.","about":"BUILD YOUR BAND. HIT THE STAGE. GO ON TOUR.\n\nStage Tour is a new rhythm-action game featuring 90+ officially licensed songs spanning six decades, 180+ authentic Gibson®, Epiphone® and Kramer® guitars, 50+ bandmates, and new ways to play.\n\nPlay your way with Lead Guitar, Groove Guitar/Bass, Drums, Vocals, PC Keyboard or gamepad, including 4-Lane and 5-Lane Arcade Mode. Choose from Easy, Medium, Hard and Expert difficulties along with Expert Plus on Drums, and take the stage with the official lineup of Stage Tour hardware.\r\n\nLAUNCHING DECEMBER 10, 2026.\r\n\n90+ OFFICIALLY LICENSED SONGS\r\nRock out to a launch setlist spanning six decades of music, featuring Metallica, The Rolling Stones, Red Hot Chili Peppers, Olivia Rodrigo, blink-182, Paramore, Slipknot, Muse and more! \r\n\n180+ COLLECTIBLE GUITARS\r\nDiscover, unlock and collect more than 180 authentic in-game Gibson®, Epiphone® and Kramer® guitars throughout Stage Tour  \r\n\nPLAY YOUR WAY\r\nSupports Lead Guitar, Groove Guitar/Bass, Drums, Vocals, PC Keyboard, and gamepad for 4-Lane and 5-Lane Arcade Mode. Pick up your instrument of choice and choose from Easy, Medium, Hard, or Expert difficulties. Or, Expert Plus on Drums.   \r\n\nGO ON TOUR\r\nTake on the all-new roguelite Tour Mode, where every run brings new choices, challenges and opportunities for your band, creating an endlessly replayable experience.  \r\n\nPLAY TOGETHER\r\nTake the stage solo or with a band in cooperative multiplayer with local or online play, including cross-platform play. Mix and match instruments in any combination and play together your way.  \r\n\nBUILD YOUR BAND\r\nChoose from 50+ unique bandmates and build a lineup that reflects your style. Mix, match and make your band your own.  \r\n\nMORE WAYS TO PLAY\r\nJump into Quickplay, sharpen your skills in Practice and Judgements, or keep things casual with Karaoke.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452700/d686edbf103454c0766095b31aee9c93c98d3d44/library_capsule.jpg?t=1794560490","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452700/7074777401ca32c928e7702567ee08c282ff7393/header.jpg?t=1794560490","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452700/6906de2dcf6fb0073a813ece035d50d89f31a344/library_hero.jpg?t=1794560490","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452700/7074777401ca32c928e7702567ee08c282ff7393/header.jpg?t=1794560490","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452700/c79468e2e515bcd2c90ee57f962ba4a1ee8394b4/ss_c79468e2e515bcd2c90ee57f962ba4a1ee8394b4.600x338.jpg?t=1794560490","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452700/c79468e2e515bcd2c90ee57f962ba4a1ee8394b4/ss_c79468e2e515bcd2c90ee57f962ba4a1ee8394b4.jpg?t=1794560490"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452700/ce3d5cd451e342448c9e343483595989f42737a8/ss_ce3d5cd451e342448c9e343483595989f42737a8.600x338.jpg?t=1794560490","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452700/ce3d5cd451e342448c9e343483595989f42737a8/ss_ce3d5cd451e342448c9e343483595989f42737a8.jpg?t=1794560490"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452700/34f9a176e8b7b0c3851973009bedccca50fc3d2a/ss_34f9a176e8b7b0c3851973009bedccca50fc3d2a.600x338.jpg?t=1794560490","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4452700/34f9a176e8b7b0c3